# Gaia-X organization and its member organizations.
#
# Source: https://gaia-x.eu/community/members-directory/#/members-directory
# Public API used by the directory map: https://membersplatform.gaia-x.eu/api/public/hs_categories/map
# Snapshot: 2026-11-13. 232 member organizations from 146 cities in 37 countries.
#
# Member subjects are the organization website host (www stripped), so the
# same organization keeps its identifier when the directory is refreshed.
# City-level locations live in locations.ttl; only members that publish a
# city and country get an ex:location link.
#
# Seeded with `devbox run seed -- static` (see scripts/fuseki.ts).

@prefix ex: <http://example.org#> .

